      "content": "thanks. number 4 is interesting. when you say \"non-local,\" are there certain types of travelers or cultural groups that usually act differently in a quiet setting like ours? like, are there specific demographics or groups from certain areas that we should be more aware of to avoid any friction with our regular high-end guests?",
